---
const base = (import.meta.env.BASE_URL || "/").replace(/\/$/, "");
const href = (path: string) => `${base}${path}`;
const title = "Actuate | Native control for agents and applications";
const description = "Inspect native interfaces and orchestrate interactions. Compose Rust providers, use the CLI, or keep a persistent session for your agent.";
const canonical = new URL(`${base}/`, Astro.site).href;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f7f4" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:image" content={new URL(`${base}/og/index.png`, Astro.site).href} />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content={new URL(`${base}/og/index.png`, Astro.site).href} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={href("/mark.svg")} />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header>
      <a class="brand" href={href("/")}><img src={href("/mark.svg")} width="30" height="30" alt="" />Actuate</a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
        <a href={href("/docs")}>Documentation</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Rajaniraiyn/actuate">GitHub <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="headline">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">NATIVE UI AUTOMATION</p>
          <h1 id="headline">Native control for your agents and applications.</h1>
          <p class="intro">Inspect interfaces and orchestrate interactions across platforms. Compose Actuate in your code or run it from the terminal.</p>
          <div class="links">
            <a class="button" href={href("/docs/quick-start")}>Get started <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            <a class="secondary" href={href("/docs/build/rust")}>Build with Rust</a>
          </div>
          <p class="availability">Rust and CLI available from source. Language SDKs and agent integrations planned.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="terminal" aria-label="Example Actuate session">
          <div class="terminal-title"><span class="status-dot"></span>actuate session --json <span class="tag">SESSION</span></div>
          <pre is:raw><code><span class="comment"># Inspect what the provider supports</span>
<span class="prompt">→</span> {"op":"capabilities"}

<span class="comment"># Discover native applications</span>
<span class="prompt">→</span> {"op":"discover"}

<span class="comment"># Observe the selected process</span>
<span class="prompt">→</span> {"op":"observe","request":{
    "pid":1234,
    "max_nodes":100
  }}</code></pre>
          <div class="terminal-note">One process. Retained connections and references.</div>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="entrypoints" aria-labelledby="entrypoints-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="entrypoints-title">Choose how to use it.</h2><p>The same core, with an interface for your workflow.</p></div>
        <div class="cards">
          <a class="card" href={href("/docs/build/rust")}><span class="number">01 / BUILD</span><h3>Compose in code <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Combine observation, input, capture, and cursor providers through Rust traits.</p><span class="detail">Rust today · TypeScript and Python planned</span></a>
          <a class="card" href={href("/docs/automate/commands")}><span class="number">02 / AUTOMATE</span><h3>Work from the terminal <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Inspect apps and run persistent sessions with explicit targets and structured results.</p><span class="detail">CLI · JSONL sessions</span></a>
          <a class="card" href={href("/docs/connect")}><span class="number">03 / CONNECT</span><h3>Give agents control <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Use the CLI through local command tools. Follow the planned MCP, skill, and plugin adapters.</p><span class="detail">Dedicated integrations planned</span></a>
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="principles" aria-labelledby="principles-title">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">APPS, WINDOWS, DESKTOPS</p><h2 id="principles-title">Know what you target.<br />Observe what changed.</h2></div>
        <div><p>Query capabilities before acting. Keep references within their session. Choose semantic actions or an explicit input route, then inspect the result.</p><p>Providers cover Windows, macOS, Linux, Android, and Apple devices and simulators. Support depends on the platform and route.</p><a class="text-link" href={href("/docs/platforms")}>Read the platform guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer><span>Actuate</span><div><a href={href("/docs/design")}>API design</a><a href="https://useblume.dev/">Built with Blume</a></div></footer>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
  :global(*){box-sizing:border-box} :global(html){color-scheme:light dark;scroll-behavior:smooth}
  :global(body){margin:0;background:#f8f7f4;color:#222226;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
  :global(a){color:inherit;text-decoration:none} :global(a:focus-visible){outline:3px solid #7452e8;outline-offset:6px;border-radius:3px}
  header,main,footer{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding-inline:40px} header{height:100px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #deddd8}
  .brand{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;font-size:21px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.6px} nav{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:14px} nav a:hover,.text-link:hover{color:#7452e8}
  .skip{position:absolute;top:-100px;padding:12px;background:#fff;color:#222;z-index:10}.skip:focus{top:12px;left:12px}
  .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr 1fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;padding:108px 0 96px}
  .eyebrow,.number{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#675886}
  h1{font-size:clamp(38px,4.8vw,62px);line-height:1.06;letter-spacing:-2.5px;font-weight:550;margin:24px 0}
  .intro{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:#64636b;max-width:470px}.links{display:flex;gap:25px;align-items:center;margin-top:30px}
  .button{background:#7452e8;color:white;padding:14px 20px;border-radius:7px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;display:flex;gap:28px}.button:hover{background:#6341d6}.secondary{font-size:14px;border-bottom:1px solid #b9b6bd;padding-block:6px}
  .availability{font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#76717c;max-width:390px;margin-top:24px}
  .terminal{background:#211f28;color:#e2dde9;border:1px solid #37333f;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 20px 65px #25203013;overflow:hidden;min-width:0}
  .terminal-title{font-family:ui-monospace,Consolas,monospace;padding:18px;border-bottom:1px solid #393440;font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px}.status-dot{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#b59bed}.tag{margin-left:auto;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#b6acc1}
  pre{margin:0;padding:25px 22px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;overflow:auto}code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}.comment{color:#aaa0b8}.prompt{color:#c6acf7}.terminal-note{padding:15px 20px;border-top:1px solid #393440;color:#b4aabe;font-size:11px}
  .entrypoints{padding:0 0 75px}.section-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:25px}h2{font-size:27px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:-.8px;line-height:1.25}.section-heading p{font-size:14px;color:#6c6771}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid #dedbd5;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}.card{padding:28px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.card+.card{border-left:1px solid #dedbd5}.card:hover{background:#f0ede7}h3{font-size:18px;font-weight:550;letter-spacing:-.4px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin:25px 0 10px}.card p{font-size:14px;color:#67616f;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 22px}.detail{font-size:11px;color:#746780;margin-top:auto;line-height:1.6}
  .principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;padding:55px 0 75px;border-top:1px solid #dedbd5}.principles h2{font-size:33px;margin-top:24px}.principles p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;color:#67616f}.text-link{font-size:14px;display:inline-block;margin-top:10px}
  footer{padding-block:30px;border-top:1px solid #dedbd5;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#746b7d;font-size:12px}footer div{display:flex;gap:25px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.hero{gap:30px;padding-block:65px}h1{font-size:44px}.card{padding:22px}.section-heading{display:block}}
  @media(max-width:680px){header,main,footer{padding-inline:22px}header{height:80px}nav{gap:16px;font-size:12px}.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-block:45px;gap:30px}h1{font-size:44px;max-width:500px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card+.card{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #dedbd5}.principles{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:8px;padding-block:35px}.entrypoints{padding-bottom:40px}footer div{gap:15px}}
  @media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:global(body){background:#17161a;color:#eeebf2}header,footer,.principles,.cards,.card+.card{border-color:#36323d}.intro,.section-heading p,.card p,.principles p:not(.eyebrow){color:#b2aaba}.eyebrow,.number,.detail,.availability,footer{color:#b1a0c7}.card:hover{background:#221f29}.terminal{box-shadow:none}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){:global(html){scroll-behavior:auto}}
</style>
